#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.ksquares.appdata.xml:12
msgid "KSquares is a game modeled after the well known pen and paper based game of Dots and Boxes. Each player takes it in turns to draw a line between two adjacent dots on the board. The objective is to complete more squares than your opponents."
msgstr "KSquares je igra nadahnuta poznatom igrom na papiru Točke i kvadrati. Igrači naizmjence povlače crtu između dviju susjednih točaka na ploči. Cilj je dovršiti više kvadrata od protivnika."

